  "source_repo": "dahatake/RoyalytyService2ndGen",
  "source_commit": "d043561a",
  "local_patches": [
    "install.ps1 / install.py: force UTF-8 (stream and console code page) so Japanese output is readable on Windows",
    "mdq.ps1: restore PYTHONPATH and the console encoding, and reach the documented exit code 2",
    "mdq.ps1 / mdq.sh / launch.py: correct the vendor-missing hint for a copied kit",
    "vendor/mdq/indexer.py + vendor/mdq/config.py: never walk dependency or build trees, and honour [index].exclude",
    "init_config.py: keep distribution kits and virtualenvs out of the generated roots and excludes",
    "benchmark.py / eval_semantic.py: import the vendored engine, resolve the target repository from the working directory, and emit UTF-8",
    "eval_semantic.py: --fixtures is required because the kit ships no corpus",
    "generate_usage_report.py: find the repository by walking up to .git instead of assuming a nesting depth",
    "skill/SKILL.md: document the bundled launcher for repositories where `python -m mdq` is not importable",
    "kit/kit_setup.py: a failing config scaffolder reports its own message instead of a traceback",
    "install.ps1: -Version / -Verify report the kit without bootstrapping a toolchain",
    "sync-vendor.ps1 / sync-vendor.sh: delegate to the bundled kit/kit_sync.py",
    "README.md / USAGE.md / GETTING-STARTED.md / kit.toml: procedures and links match this distribution layout"
  ],
